# Race 3D asset budgets

Hero car mesh limits live in `src/client/src/pages/Race/budgets.json`:

| Limit | Value |
|-------|--------|
| Warn triangles | 25,000 |
| **Fail (CI)** triangles | **30,000** |
| Max texture edge | 2048px |
| Max GLB size | 8 MB |

## When changing Race 3D assets

1. Place the shipped car at `src/client/src/pages/Race/models/race-car.glb` (or update `budgets.json` path deliberately).
2. Run `npm run check:race-budget` from the repo root before opening a PR.
3. Do **not** raise `maxTriangles` without explicit intent — decimate or simplify the model first.
4. Update `src/client/src/pages/Race/README.md` if paths or limits change.

CI runs the same check via GitHub Actions and will **fail the build** above 30k triangles.
